    {
      "topic": "Explicit epsilon and arbitrary-amplitude spectrum",
      "implementation": "Stable Frobenius normalization handles finite large and tiny inputs without norm overflow; erank accepts unnormalized nonnegative spectra; optional epsilon separates normalization scale from precision."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Independent head counterexample",
      "implementation": "Constructed diagonal gradient with 10:1 head amplitude ratio; whole-matrix Pion nearly suppresses the second head while per-head normalization yields equal output block norms. No claim of preserving weight-norm ratios."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Official parameter routing and stopping conditions",
      "implementation": "Pinned VLA parameter-name exclusions, proprio projector O routing, RL projection head axes and three GSM8K scripts; separated total_epochs=15 from the paper 40-step budget."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Numerical precision",
      "implementation": "Hash-gated official PyTorch CPU BF16 probe distinguishes epsilon=0 Float64, epsilon=1e-7 Float64 and official BF16 helper; checked underflow without claiming GPU agreement."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Interactive explanation",
      "implementation": "Four raw amplitudes, six fixed-budget schedules, optional epsilon, four presets, original/output erank and output norms; selectable table plus three labeled SVG curves. Native default results survive blocked scripts and failed initial SVG setup."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Conceptual flow",
      "implementation": "New whole-matrix/per-head update-flow figure; per-block five-step label checked against source and diagram arrows."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Frobenius budget",
      "implementation": "Derived count of output coefficients >=0.5 from the normalized squared-sum budget; sharp equal-spectrum and randomized checks distinguish amplitude count from mathematical rank."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Native PDF chart width",
      "implementation": "Reproduced mobile-origin native PDF axis span125.156pt vs414.656pt after fix. beforeprint can run before print media; draw in a624px coordinate system shared with CSS and force screen geometry redraw after print. No focus movement."
