    },
    {
      "topic": "Labeled clean-signal comparison",
      "implementation": "Same known rank-one diagonal signal with weak-tail or dominant fixed perturbation; Pion improves alignment in the first and suppresses true weak signal in the second. Standard-library script, saved JSON, independent90-digit cosine check and ZIP included. Not statistical SNR or training accuracy."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Scientific-number wrapping",
